{
  "_comment": [
    "Report 593 — 'LAB Result Time' (Lab Census Report).",
    "Captured from the portal's own GetReportData request, unchanged apart from",
    "the two dates and loginUserId, which the server fills in per request.",
    "Two things here are not like the other reports: its date parameters are",
    "named 'From Date' and 'To Date' with spaces, and it calls the sample",
    "LIS_SAMPLE_NO — both are spelled out in _meta so the join still lands.",
    "Visit Type and Category Name are left at '%'. Service Name is not: this",
    "report will not answer a whole day across every service, so test_filter",
    "below has it asked one service at a time, for the test names the samples",
    "received report brought back over the same span.",
    "Its rows are per analyte — finer than a test — so the analyte columns are",
    "skipped and only the sample's own times are joined on.",
    "Re-capture it the same way if the HIS ever changes the report's filters."
  ],
